msgstr "IBM Watson Studio {#ibm-watson-studio}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Set up Watson Studio free trial](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/watson?topic=watson-about).\n"
msgstr "[ตั้งค่า Watson Studio รุ่นทดลองฟรี](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/watson?topic=watson-about)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Create a Watson Studio Project](https://www.ibm.com/docs/db2-event-store/2.0.0?topic=data-projects#d275537e106).\n"
msgstr "[สร้างโปรเจกต์ Watson Studio](https://www.ibm.com/docs/db2-event-store/2.0.0?topic=data-projects#d275537e106)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
