#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Create a Jupyter notebook in your workspace](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/machine-learning/how-to-run-jupyter-notebooks?view=azureml-api-2).\n"
msgstr "[สร้าง Jupyter notebook ใน workspace ของคุณ](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/machine-learning/how-to-run-jupyter-notebooks?view=azureml-api-2)\n"

